hifiberry-gmediarender (0.3.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * UPnP/DLNA media renderer integration for HiFiBerryOS
  * Based on gmrender-resurrect via the gmediarender Debian package
  * Includes metadata bridge for AudioControl (ACR) integration
  * Drop-in registration for Web UI, configserver, and ACR
  * Ships DLNA icon for player registry

